<!-- ============ EXTENSIBILITY ============ -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="feature-row feature-solo">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Room to Diverge</span>
        <h2>Scale without forking the platform.</h2>
        <p>Growing brands develop workflows nobody else has. That shouldn't mean a custom build that freezes you on an old version — custom services integrate through external APIs while the core stays on the upgrade path.</p>
        <ul class="feature-bullets">
          <li>Custom external APIs and logic overlays streamline your specific workflows without altering the core POS codebase</li>
          <li>Module sequence, order, and exposure configured per retailer, so the interface matches how your stores actually operate</li>
          <li>Open APIs for importing and exporting product and customer information alongside the systems you already run</li>
          <li>One codebase underneath, which means one upgrade path rather than a per-integration regression cycle</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Talk to a solutions architect <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

